{
  "key": 19965,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_LectureCStudent",
      "en_US": [
        "Hyacinth says they’ll Protect\n",
        "the slot I’m aiming at. But what\r",
        "if they know I know that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_TeacherMenu",
      "en_US": "What shall we do?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_OptDemo",
      "en_US": "Demo Battle"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_OptLecture",
      "en_US": "the Lecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_OptBye",
      "en_US": "That’s All"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_MarigoldLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Marigold: Weather and terrain.\n",
        "Bring an umbrella!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_MarigoldLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "Weather is even stronger in\n",
        "doubles: one setter powers up\r",
        "both its partners.\r",
        "Drizzle, Drought, Sand Stream\n",
        "and Snow Warning last five\r",
        "turns; eight with the right\n",
        "rock."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_MarigoldLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Swift Swim, Chlorophyll, Sand\n",
        "Rush and Slush Rush double a\r",
        "Pokémon’s speed in their\n",
        "weather. Rain makes Thunder and\r",
        "Hurricane never miss.\r",
        "The setter’s partner should be\n",
        "the abuser. Lead with them\r",
        "together!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_MarigoldLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Terrains last five turns too.\n",
        "Psychic Terrain blocks Fake out\r",
        "and other priority. Grassy\n",
        "Terrain weakens Earthquake.\r",
        "Remember: the last weather set\n",
        "wins. Keep the setter safe to\r",
        "bring it back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_HyacinthLecture0",
      "en_US": [
        "Hyacinth: Targeting and Protect.\n",
        "Sit down, please."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_HyacinthLecture1",
      "en_US": [
        "Two of you, two of them. The\n",
        "question every turn is: who do\r",
        "we hit?\r",
        "Doubling up on one foe takes it\n",
        "out fast. But if it uses\r",
        "Protect, both your attacks are\n",
        "wasted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_HyacinthLecture2",
      "en_US": [
        "Protect is the most important\n",
        "move in doubles. It scouts, it\r",
        "stalls weather and Trick Room,\n",
        "and it baits double attacks.\r",
        "But it can fail if used twice in\n",
        "a row. Count them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_HyacinthLecture3",
      "en_US": [
        "Watch which slot they protect,\n",
        "who they target, which Pokémon\r",
        "they keep in the back.\r",
        "Spread your damage when you\n",
        "can’t read them. Focus it when\r",
        "you can."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_DemoIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: A demonstration! A\n",
        "double battle, and we both use\r",
        "rentals, three each.\r",
        "My team shows off the lesson.\n",
        "Choose yours wisely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_DemoWon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Wonderful! Here,\n",
        "you’ve earned it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_RentalReturn",
      "en_US": [
        "Your own Pokémon are back with\n",
        "you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_DemoLost",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ha! Think about the\n",
        "lesson and try again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_EarnedBP",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} earned {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} BP!\n",
        "(Total: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} BP)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_RentalPick",
      "en_US": [
        "Choose a rental Pokémon.\n",
        "({STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} of 3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0978_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_LECTURE_C_Academy_Text_RentalInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}\r",
        "Take this one?"
      ]
    },
    {
